cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "The Empty Field That Wasn't: GPS, OTAD and Two Decades of Encrypted Broadcasts (pipeline, analysis, figures, and verifiers for the GPS L1 C/A Subframe 4 Page 17 corpus, 2007–2026)"
abstract: >
  Code, data pipeline, analysis scripts, article figures, and claim-level
  verifiers accompanying Murdoch (2026), "The Empty Field That Wasn't:
  GPS, OTAD, and Two Decades of Encrypted Broadcasts" (Inside GNSS,
  May/June 2026). Reproduces 24,087,691 special-message observations
  across 5,009 unique payloads from the GFZ Potsdam navigation-bit
  archive, 2007-06-19 to 2026-01-23 (the corrected v2 corpus; see
  CHANGELOG.md for the v1 correction record).
